'''Togekiss''' (Japanese: '''トゲキッス''' ''Togekiss'') is a {{ct|Psychic}} Stage 2 Pokémon card in [[Pokémon Trading Card Game Pocket]]. It is part of the {{TCGP|Space-Time Smackdown}} expansion.

