==Trivia==
===Origin===
*This card's illustration was first featured on {{TCG ID|Supreme Victors|Togekiss C|86}} from the {{TCG|Supreme Victors}} expansion.
*'''Overdrive Smash''' is an attack that first appeared on {{TCG ID|BW Promo|Genesect|86}}, one of the {{TCG|BW Black Star Promos}}.
*This card's [[Pokédex]] entry comes from {{g|Sword}}.

